sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as S3 Payment (Consumer)
    participant K as Kafka Broker
    participant P as S4 Risk (Provider)

    Note over C: POST /api/v1/transfers received<br/>transfer saved in DB with status=PENDING

    C->>K: Produce AssessRisk command<br/>topic: lab.s3.s4.command.risk.assess.v1<br/>key: transaction_id
    K-->>C: Broker ACK (offset committed)
    Note over C: transfer.status to RISK_CHECKING

    alt success - S4 decision APPROVED
        K-->>C: Consume AssessmentResult<br/>outcome: APPLIED, decision: APPROVED
        Note over C: transfer.status to HOLDING<br/>S3 starts next step (HoldFunds to S2)
    else rejected - S4 decision REJECTED
        K-->>C: Consume AssessmentResult<br/>outcome: APPLIED, decision: REJECTED
        Note over C: transfer.status to RISK_REJECTED<br/>transfer FAILED, no money moved
    else manual-review - S4 decision MANUAL_REVIEW
        K-->>C: Consume AssessmentResult<br/>outcome: APPLIED, decision: MANUAL_REVIEW
        Note over C: transfer.status to RISK_MANUAL_REVIEW<br/>transfer pending human review
    else validation-error - S4 rejects invalid payload
        K-->>C: Consume AssessmentResult<br/>outcome: REJECTED, error.code: VALIDATION_ERROR
        Note over C: transfer.status to FAILED
    else no response - S4 does not answer / 5xx / timeout
        Note over C: timeout (10s) - no message from S4
        Note over C: transfer.status to RISK_MANUAL_REVIEW<br/>safe timeout, no debit
    end
